  "description": "Compile-time type-safe physical quantities for .NET. Every quantity (voltage, force, pressure, temperature and more) is its own readonly struct over a single double in SI base units, so dimensionally invalid operations do not compile and the safety costs nothing at run time. Includes unit conversions for all SI prefixes and common alternate units, and a runtime PhysicalQuantity type with full dimensional analysis.",
